--[[
	Bosses (bl_ ids): named, dangerous fights that turn up as random events. Each one is a
	real fight (coins 3-4, base 7-9) with a survivable way out: a check, a payment or a
	retreat. Winning drops a unique weapon, armor, charm or book (Gear/Loot, Books/Loot).
	More bosses live in expeditions (Expeditions/Loot.luau).
	Flags: bl_slew_<boss> (beaten, so that boss doesn't come back), bl_trophy (any boss),
	bl_found_legendary / bl_found_unreal (records and titles).
]]

